Error [jet.DriverOperationFailed]: Can't read the Core library source `{work}/empty/Core/App/App.jet`
 Why: Jet could not complete the named file, tool, or operating-system operation
 Fix: Set `JET_TOOLCHAIN_ROOT` to the Jet toolchain source tree, the directory that holds `Core/`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2105
